.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# A Group with parameters coming from XWiki Syntax 2.1 (e.g. an info box inserted with the WYSIWYG editor's
.# Styles dropdown), as the first element of the document.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
(% class="box infomessage" %)
(((
hello world
)))

(((
no parameters
)))
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<div class="box infomessage">

hello world

</div>

<div>

no parameters

</div>
